It's an extension of standard no-MR policy for most players; if I don't
have MR after Minetown/Soko, and #dipping in low-DL fountains doesn't
net a wish, I don't do Mines' end.  I head straight for the castle as
quickly as possible, not exploring levels fully but just finding the
stairs.

